+
+**Inert vs. live config.** A config value sits on the light row only while changing it cannot
+alter behaviour. A Runtime timeout, a permission setting or any limit that gates execution is
+runtime- or security-affecting config: it takes the expanded route with the full card, and its
+promise needs behavioural evidence that the new value is observed — parsing or shape validation
+alone is not proof.
 
